title: "Nicaraguan Environmental Legislation: Ecosystem Services Screening"
abstract: "Computational workflow, source documents and screening datasets used to identify and screen Nicaraguan legislation related to ecosystem services, based on the 'Medio Ambiente y Recursos Naturales' grouping of the Asamblea Nacional de Nicaragua legislative repository."
